<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109174" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσπάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw away from under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.197
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σκολύθριά τινων ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					278b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν κίονα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					255b25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινὰ ἐκ τῶν ποδῶν,</span>
			i. e. trip him up, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				44
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.535f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>draw off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὑποστάθμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Protagorid.
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῆς ποσότητος τοῦ γάλακτος</span>
			<i>reduce</i> the baby's ration of milk, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.116
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>withdraw secretly. filch away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίμνης νεογνὸν θρέμμ᾽ ὑποσπάσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					495
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέσπασεν φυγῇ πόδα</span>
			<i>withdrew</i> his foot <i>secretly,</i> stole away, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				436
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσπάσασθαι</span> in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				7.8
			</span></i> is (prob.) <i>to draw one's skirts from under one,</i> of
			a horseman after mounting:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be withdrawn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Somn.Vig.</u>
				457b24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰπεῖν ὑ.</span>
			<i>refuse</i> to say, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.23
			</span></i> O.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
